4. HARDWARE SAFETY NOTICE
   BikeOS controls physical outputs (lights, an anti-theft buzzer) and
   reads sensor data used for rider-facing information. This Software is
   provided for hobbyist/personal use. It has not been certified for use
   as a safety-critical or life-safety system. Do not rely on any
   speed, distance, or alert reading from this Software as your sole
   source of safety information while riding.

